                            </h2>
                            <p style="line-height: 1.8; color: #555;">
                                You agree to provide current, accurate and complete account data and purchase information for all purchases made through the site including email, payment method and payment card expiration date so that we can complete your transactions and contact you as needed. 
                                You also agree to promptly update account and payment information with you if required.
                            </p>
                            <p style="line-height: 1.8; color: #555;">
                                The sales tax value will be added to the purchase price according to what we deem required. Prices may be subject to change by us at any time. All payments must be in UAE Dirhams. 
                                Note that while paying, your bank may charge you additional fees for paying in a different currency, and the currency rate is subject to change.
                            </p>
                            <p style="line-height: 1.8; color: #555;">
                                You agree to pay all fees for your purchases at the applicable prices and any applicable shipping fees, and you authorize us to collect from your payment provider the necessary amounts for any such fees when you place an order. 
                                If your order is subject to a periodic fee, you agree to charge your Payment Method on a periodic basis without requiring your prior approval on each transaction for such fee, until such time as you cancel the order.
                            </p>
                            <p style="line-height: 1.8; color: #555;">
                                We reserve the right to correct any pricing errors or inaccuracies even if we have requested or received payment. We reserve the right to refuse any order placed through the Site. 
                                We may, at our sole discretion, limit or cancel quantities purchased per person, household or order. These restrictions could include orders placed by or under the same customer account, the same payment method, or those that use the same address of invoicing or of expedition.
                            </p>
                            <p style="line-height: 1.8; color: #555;">
                                We also reserve the right to limit or prohibit orders, in our sole judgment, that appear to have been placed by dealers, resellers or distributors. 
                                Note that liquidation products are not subject to exchange or cancellation.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Validity -->
                    <div class="card mb-4 border-0 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="card-body p-4">
                            <h2 class="mb-4" style="color: #1976D2; font-weight: 700;">
                                <i class="bi bi-person-check me-3"></i>Validity
